      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, thanks. I'll check the sensor logs for any signs of hardware malfunction or calibration drift. Just to be thorough, are there any specific statistical methods or outlier detection algorithms you'd recommend for filtering out these kinds of non-linear noise spikes from the main dataset?",
